 <p>&quot;The title&quot; garbage
 <a href="/bla">bla</a></p>
 ````````````````````````````````
+
+CJK characters and punctuation participate in emphasis flanking.
+
+```````````````````````````````` example
+これは**「重要なこと」**です。
+
+語*「引用」*語
+
+**안녕(hello)**하세요.
+
+𠮷**(U+20BB7)**語
+
+a**「x」**b
+.
+<p>これは<strong>「重要なこと」</strong>です。</p>
+<p>語<em>「引用」</em>語</p>
+<p><strong>안녕(hello)</strong>하세요.</p>
+<p>𠮷<strong>(U+20BB7)</strong>語</p>
+<p>a<strong>「x」</strong>b</p>
+````````````````````````````````
+
+Whitespace, underscores, emoji, and variation selectors keep their existing behavior.
+
+```````````````````````````````` example
+語__「強調」__語
+
+語** 強調**語
+
+a**😀。**b
+
+禰󠄀**(ね)**豆子
+.
+<p>語__「強調」__語</p>
+<p>語** 強調**語</p>
+<p>a**😀。**b</p>
+<p>禰󠄀**(ね)**豆子</p>
+````````````````````````````````
